# surfnWOB: hoist @lexical/* sub-packages to the top level so Showdex's direct
# `@lexical/{code,link,list,markdown,rich-text,table}` imports resolve under
# pnpm's strict (non-hoisted) linker. Upstream imports these sub-packages but
# only declares @lexical/react + lexical, which happened to work under the old
# yarn (flat-hoist) toolchain; the pnpm 10 switch in v1.4.0 broke it.
public-hoist-pattern[]=@lexical/*
